<title>USA: Just Toys names Shapiro president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Just Toys names Shapiro president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Just Toys Inc Monday named Barry Shapiro to replace Morton J. Levy as the firm's chairman and chief executive officer, effective July 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Shapiro is currently president and chief operating officer of the firm, they said.</p>
<p>Levy will remain chairman of the board.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
